{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:39:02+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T07:39:02+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Brembo N.V.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"Italy","city":"Bergamo","website":"https://www.brembo.com","employees":15344,"summary":"Brembo N.V., together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, and distributes braking systems and components for cars, motorbikes, and commercial vehicles. The company operates through Discs Systems Motorbikes; and Aftermarket Performance Group suspensions segments. It offers various products for car and commercial vehicle applications, including brake discs, brake calipers, single-wheel modules, and braking systems; and integrated engineering services for light commercial and heavy industrial vehicles, motorbikes, and racing competitions. The company also provides brake master cylinders, light-alloy wheels, brake hoses, pads, drums, brake shoes, drum-brake kits, and hydraulic components. In addition, it offers braking systems for race cars and motorbikes under the Brembo Racing brand; braking systems and clutches for race cars under the AP Racing brand; and magnesium and aluminum wheels for racing motorbikes under the Marchesini brand. The company operates in Italy, Germany, France, the United Kingdom, India, China, Japan, Argentina, Brazil, Mexico, Canada, other European countries, the United States of America, other Asian countries, and internationally. The company was founded in 1961 and is headquartered in Bergamo, Italy. Brembo N.V. operates as a subsidiary of Nuova Fourb S.R.L.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Brembo N.V., avec ses filiales, conçoit, développe et distribue des systèmes de freinage et des composants pour voitures, motos et véhicules utilitaires. La société opère par le biais de Discs Systems Motorbikes et de segments de suspensions Aftermarket Performance Group. Il offre divers produits pour les applications automobiles et les véhicules commerciaux, y compris les disques de frein, les étriers de frein, les modules à roues simples et les systèmes de freinage; et des services d'ingénierie intégrés pour les véhicules utilitaires légers et les véhicules industriels lourds, les motos et les compétitions de course."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":null,"shares_outstanding":null,"trailing_pe":14.457143,"forward_pe":12.062553,"price_to_book":1.3266912,"ev_to_ebitda":7.092,"ev_to_revenue":1.045,"dividend_yield":0.0295,"payout_ratio":0.4286,"beta_yahoo":1.052},"targets":{"current_price":10.12,"mean":11.51,"median":11.5,"high":13.5,"low":9.0,"n_analysts":10,"reco_mean":2.2,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":0.19696,"eps_low":0.19,"eps_high":0.20393,"revenue_avg":989000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-18","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.53563,"institutions_pct":0.19044,"institutions_float_pct":0.41009998,"institutions_n":123,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD TRUSTEES' EQUITY FUND-Vanguard International Value Fund","pct":0.022,"shares":3409443,"value":34503562,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0769},{"name":"HARTFORD MUTUAL FUNDS INC/CT-The Hartford International Value Fund","pct":0.0136,"shares":2100197,"value":21253993,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0135,"shares":2092531,"value":21176413,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0339},{"name":"Fidelity Puritan Trust-Fidelity Low-Priced Stock Fund","pct":0.012999999,"shares":2012262,"value":20364091,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0092,"shares":1431149,"value":14483227,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0431},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0075,"shares":1154674,"value":11685300,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0138}